From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gamejay <gamejay@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Define FCEU_VERSION_NUMERIC in state.c

The constant FCEU_VERSION_NUMERIC is referenced in state.c but was never
defined in the codebase. Based on the comment in state.c it was bumped
to 9900 together with the FlipByteOrder fix in this commit.
---
 src/state.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/state.c b/src/state.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/state.c
+++ b/src/state.c
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@ int SFEXINDEX;
 /* Convenience aliases for the SFORMAT 's' field bit layout. The
  * encoding is documented in state.h. */
 #define RLSB         FCEUSTATE_RLSB
+#define FCEU_VERSION_NUMERIC 9900
 #define STRIDE_MASK  FCEUSTATE_STRIDE_MASK
 #define STRIDE_SHIFT FCEUSTATE_STRIDE_SHIFT
 #define SIZE_MASK    FCEUSTATE_SIZE_MASK
